<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  THE ANDROID 12+ SPLASH ICON. Icon content ONLY - deliberately no background fill.

  This is the drawable behind android:windowSplashScreenAnimatedIcon in
  Platforms/Android/Resources/values/styles.xml, and it exists because of a specific,
  measured defect. .NET MAUI's Maui.SplashTheme points that attribute at
  @drawable/maui_splash, and the library's maui_splash is a LAYER-LIST whose first item
  is a solid @color/maui_splash_color fill (with android:opacity="opaque"). The system
  treats the whole layer-list as icon content, so it masks the opaque fill into the icon
  shape and draws the logo inside it. That is the "tiny logo on an oddly shaped navy
  patch" symptom: one third of the foreground is masked away and the part that survives
  is a colour swatch.

  THE TWO SIZE NUMBERS, AND WHY THIS FILE IS 288dp
  =================================================
  Android's spec for the splash app-icon area:
      with an icon background     240 x 240dp, guaranteed-visible circle 160dp
      with no icon background     288 x 288dp, guaranteed-visible circle 192dp
  The old path put a layer-list whose item was hard-sized to 108dp into that area, so the
  logo rendered at 108/240 = 45% of the intended size (and the mark inside that item at
  108 * 0.59 = 63dp). MAUI 10.0.101 exposes no attribute, metadata or property to change
  that 108dp box.

  So the size is fixed here instead, by the drawable's own intrinsic size:
      288dp intrinsic on a 108 viewport  =>  the mark (60.75dp of 108) lands at
      60.75 / 108 * 288 = 162.0dp across, i.e. 84% of the 192dp guaranteed-visible
      circle, with 15dp of margin inside it.
  That is 2.6x the old 63dp.

  A larger intrinsic size is safe under either model the platform might use: with
  FIT_CENTER the drawable is scaled down to whatever the container is (so a 240dp or
  160dp OEM container still gives a bigger, correct mark), and with an exact/intrinsic
  container 288dp is what the spec asks for.

  No windowSplashScreenIconBackgroundColor is set, deliberately. The splash background is
  already navy #143D59 and the mark is gold, so painting an icon background circle would
  only add a visible disc - and omitting it is also what selects the roomier 288/192
  geometry over the 240/160 one.

  Geometry, path data and the reasoning behind it: drawable/cafepos_mark.xml. The only
  difference from that file is the intrinsic size (288dp vs 108dp) and the lack of any
  background layer. Do not add one - a fill here is the bug being fixed.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="288dp"
    android:height="288dp"
    android:viewportWidth="108"
    android:viewportHeight="108">

    <!-- cup body: 26.0 wide, y 42..71 -->
    <path
        android:fillColor="#F2C14E"
        android:pathData="M34,42 L60,42 L56.5,64 C55.4,68.7 51.6,71 47,71 C42.4,71 38.6,68.7 37.5,64 Z" />

    <!-- handle: stroked ring, r 5.75 stroke 3.5, so the 8.0 counter is real negative space -->
    <path
        android:fillColor="#00000000"
        android:strokeColor="#F2C14E"
        android:strokeWidth="3.5"
        android:pathData="M64.65,45.75 C67.83,45.75 70.4,48.32 70.4,51.5 C70.4,54.68 67.83,57.25 64.65,57.25 C61.47,57.25 58.9,54.68 58.9,51.5 C58.9,48.32 61.47,45.75 64.65,45.75 Z" />

    <!-- steam: two curls, 11.0 tall on a 3.0 stroke, 4.0 apart, 2.5 clear of the rim -->
    <path
        android:fillColor="#00000000"
        android:strokeColor="#F2C14E"
        android:strokeWidth="3"
        android:strokeLineCap="round"
        android:pathData="M43,38 C40.8,33.5 45.2,31.5 45,27" />
    <path
        android:fillColor="#00000000"
        android:strokeColor="#F2C14E"
        android:strokeWidth="3"
        android:strokeLineCap="round"
        android:pathData="M52,38 C49.8,33.5 54.2,31.5 54,27" />

    <!-- saucer: 35.0 wide rounded bar, y 73..79, 2.0 clear of the cup base -->
    <path
        android:fillColor="#F2C14E"
        android:pathData="M39,73 L68,73 C69.66,73 71,74.34 71,76 C71,77.66 69.66,79 68,79 L39,79 C37.34,79 36,77.66 36,76 C36,74.34 37.34,73 39,73 Z" />
</vector>
